<title>UK: CADES prices $1.0 billion five-year bond, +5 bp.</title>
<headline>CADES prices $1.0 billion five-year bond, +5 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Goldman Sachs International, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE D'AMOTISSEMENT DE LA DETTE SOCIALE (CADES)</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    11.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.538   PAY DATE    11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.913    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
